  "description": "<p>The Qinghai-Tibet Plateau earthquake catalog (1970&ndash;2022) is sourced from the China Earthquake Networks Center (CENC). The data covers the period from January 1, 1970, to December 31, 2022, and includes the geographic range of 20&deg;N&ndash;45&deg;N and 75&deg;E&ndash;110&deg;E.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For detailed information and data access, please refer to <a href=\"https://news.ceic.ac.cn/history.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Historical Earthquake Catalog of CENC</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"https://data.earthquake.cn/datashare/report.shtml?PAGEID=earthquake_csn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CENC Data Sharing Report</a>.</p>",
